1. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The container images published for this product bundle software written by other
people. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists every component, its version, its licence
and which image carries it — 470 components at the time of writing.

That file is GENERATED, by scripts/gen-notice.sh, directly from the built images
rather than from our dependency manifests. The manifests record what we asked
for; the image records what you actually receive. Anything that cannot be
resolved from a package's own declared metadata is listed as UNDETERMINED rather
than assumed, because an attribution file that invents a licence is worse than
one that admits a gap.

We do not modify any of these components. They are installed from their
distributors (Debian, PyPI, npm) and invoked as separate programs or linked
libraries.


